27:Teb5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is LEAP's venue from Riyadh Airport and the city?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Riyadh Exhibition & Convention Centre is in Malham, north-west of Riyadh — roughly a 30–45 minute drive from King Khalid Airport (RUH) and from the central hotel districts, depending on event traffic. Because it's out of town, booking ahead avoids the end-of-day ride shortage."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it hard to get a ride when LEAP closes for the day?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — that's the main pain point. With hundreds of thousands leaving Malham within a short window, app-based cars get scarce and expensive. A pre-booked car or daily standby means your driver is waiting, at a fixed fare agreed in advance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you move an exhibitor team with equipment?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Ask for an SUV or van and we allow room for demo units, sample cases, and marketing materials, plus early-morning build-up and late breakdown runs so your stand crew reaches the halls on schedule."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you cover hotel-to-venue runs for a group?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Tell us your hotel and group size on WhatsApp and we run daily loops between your hotel and Malham with the right-sized vehicle, timed to the sessions you want to attend."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a private transfer from Riyadh Airport to LEAP in Malham?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We run private airport transfers from King Khalid Airport (RUH) straight to the Riyadh Exhibition & Convention Centre in Malham — we track your flight, meet you at arrivals, and take you directly to the venue, so you skip the taxi queue on a busy LEAP arrivals day. Fare confirmed on WhatsApp before you travel."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you provide daily transportation between my Riyadh hotel and LEAP?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Book a car on daily standby and it runs your morning drop to Malham and evening pickup for the length of LEAP — a fixed daily arrangement for individuals or small teams, so you never hunt for a ride at a remote venue. Send your hotel, dates, and passenger count on WhatsApp for a quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What time does LEAP close each day?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"LEAP is open to visitors from 1:00 PM to 9:00 PM, while exhibitors have access from 9:00 AM to 9:30 PM for stand build-up and breakdown. The busiest transport moment is the 9:00 PM close, when the crowd leaves Malham at once — which is exactly why a pre-booked car or daily standby beats waiting for an app ride at a remote venue after dark."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I drive to LEAP or book a car?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Both work. The venue has large on-site parking, so self-driving is possible if you're comfortable with Malham's out-of-town location. The real constraint is the simultaneous end-of-day exit: everyone leaves within the same short window, so the car parks and access roads back up. A pre-booked chauffeur means you're collected at the hall exit at a fixed fare, with no parking hunt or exit queue to manage yourself."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you also cover DeepFest?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. DeepFest is co-located within LEAP as its artificial-intelligence programme — same venue in Malham, same dates. Your airport transfers, hotel runs, and daily standby cover DeepFest exactly as they cover the main LEAP halls; just tell us which programme you're attending when you message us."}}]}1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C] pb-24","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"LEAP Riyadh Event Transportation\",\"description\":\"Private LEAP Riyadh transportation — airport transfers to the Riyadh Exhibition & Convention Centre in Malham, daily chauffeur standby, group and VIP cars for delegates and exhibitors. Fare confirmed on WhatsApp.\",\"serviceType\":\"Event Transportation\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/events/leap-riyadh-transportation\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/#taxiservice\"},\"areaServed\":[{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Riyadh\"}]}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/events/leap-riyadh-transportation#webpage\",\"name\":\"LEAP Riyadh Event Transportation | Airport & Venue Transfers\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/events/leap-riyadh-transportation\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/gallery/event-group-exhibition-riyadh.webp\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"LEAP\",\"startDate\":\"2026-08-31\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-03\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Riyadh Exhibition & Convention Centre, Malham\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Riyadh\",\"addressCountry\":\"SA\"}},\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Tahaluf\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://onegiantleap.com\",\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LEAP_(technology_conference)\"]}}"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$27"}}],"$L28"],"$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$undefined",false,"$L2c","$L2d","$undefined","$undefined","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31"]}]
